---
---
<section class="testimonial-hero section--cream">
  <div class="testimonial-hero__inner">
    <span class="eyebrow">What couples say</span>
    <h2 class="testimonial-hero__hook">"Choosing Casa Arkaana was the best decision."</h2>
    <blockquote class="testimonial-hero__quote">
      From the very beginning, Maja and Asdrubal welcomed us and supported us in bringing our vision to life. The closeness to nature made the wedding truly magical. We spent three days there, enjoying the jungle, and left feeling renewed.
    </blockquote>
    <p class="testimonial-hero__attribution">B &amp; A, 2024</p>

    <div class="reviews-strip">
      <div class="reviews-strip__header">
        <span class="reviews-strip__stars">★★★★★</span>
        <p class="reviews-strip__count"><strong>55 of 56 reviews</strong> on Google</p>
      </div>
      <div class="reviews-strip__list">
        <blockquote class="reviews-strip__item">
          "The best place to have a wonderful ceremony in the Maloka and to rest and digest near the pool. You will feel the love they put in the place."
          <cite class="reviews-strip__cite">— Google Review, 5 stars</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="reviews-strip__item">
          "Spending three days in the jungle with the people we love most — I can't imagine a more perfect way to start our marriage."
          <cite class="reviews-strip__cite">— Google Review, 5 stars</cite>
        </blockquote>
        <blockquote class="reviews-strip__item">
          "We left feeling renewed. The jungle held us through every moment of the ceremony."
          <cite class="reviews-strip__cite">— Google Review, 5 stars</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonial-hero {
    padding: var(--sp-10) var(--sp-4);
  }

  .testimonial-hero__inner {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .testimonial-hero__quote {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 42px);
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
    position: relative;
    padding-left: var(--sp-6);
  }

  .testimonial-hero__quote::before {
    content: '\201C';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: -8px;
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 80px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-gold);
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .testimonial-hero__attribution {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
    padding-left: var(--sp-6);
  }

  .testimonial-hero__attribution::before {
    content: '— ';
  }

  .testimonial-hero__hook {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 36px);
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-4);
  }

  .reviews-strip {
    margin-top: var(--sp-8);
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(140,136,118,0.2);
    padding-top: var(--sp-6);
  }

  .reviews-strip__header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--sp-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--sp-6);
  }

  .reviews-strip__stars {
    font-size: 18px;
    color: #F4B942;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }

  .reviews-strip__count {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
  }

  .reviews-strip__count strong {
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .reviews-strip__list {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: var(--sp-4);
  }

  .reviews-strip__item {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-style: italic;
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: 1.65;
    padding-left: var(--sp-4);
    border-left: 1px solid rgba(181,144,78,0.35);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .reviews-strip__cite {
    display: block;
    margin-top: var(--sp-2);
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-style: normal;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-neutral);
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .reviews-strip__list {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .testimonial-hero {
      padding: var(--sp-10) var(--sp-6);
    }
  }
</style>
